        "name": "Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice - Game of the Year Edition",
        "summary": "Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice received a free update following it's Game of the Year win, which included a handful of changes, outside of it's name change\n\nThis Game of the Year Edition update includes :\n\n- Reflection and Gauntlet of Strength - new boss challenge modes\n- Remnants - leave messages and recordings of your actions that other players can view and rate\n- 3 unlockable cosmetic skins",
